{
  "key_path": "EmptyAIAgentsDescription",
  "content": "Set up a personalized assistant for your team by adding a knowledge base, selecting the ideal model, and connecting an {{mcpServer}}. Invite your colleagues to collaborate and make the most of the agent’s chat capabilities.",
